 *              This file contains all functions neeeded to benchmark 
 *              multitos on synthetic LR-like data.
 *              w (inl*mult), b (promille), rep, multiarray size (msz), rrfo
 *
 ****************************************************************************
 * $Log: ub_rpsplit.osql,v $
 * Revision 1.2  2012/05/15 21:32:17  torer
